# User-defined
*output*/
# ...but `visual output/` is source, not a run directory: the ensemble viewer
# and movie renderer live there and must be committed. The rule above is aimed
# at `runs/*output*/`-style artefact directories and catches this one by name.
!visual output/
!visual output/**
.tmp_openfold/
pyrightconfig.json
*local/

